title: $:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/DashboardInboxSeparateTab
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

You can build your own Dashboard to display the
[[Inbox|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/Inbox]] as a separate tab using the
following:

```
<<tabs "$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/inbox/Inbox $:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Projects $:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Today $:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Upcoming" "$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/inbox/Inbox" "$:/state/projectify/custom-dashboard" "py-tabs">>
```
<%if [{$:/state/projectify/usage-custom-dashboard}match[show]] %>
  <$button class="py-btn btn-primary" set="$:/state/projectify/usage-custom-dashboard" setTo="">Hide</$button>
  <hr/>
  <<tabs "$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/inbox/Inbox $:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Projects $:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Today $:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Upcoming" "$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/inbox/Inbox" "$:/state/projectify/custom-dashboard" "py-tabs">>
  <hr/>
<%else%>
  <$button class="py-btn btn-primary" set="$:/state/projectify/usage-custom-dashboard" setTo="show">Show result</$button>
<%endif%>
